# onnxruntime-node downloads CUDA binaries on Linux x64 at install and fails when
# that release asset is gone (#616). Shots never uses the CUDA provider, so every
# npm ci in clients/ skips it: CI, nightly, the web images (their Dockerfiles copy
# this file) and other repositories' workflows that check this one out.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
